{
  "info": {
    "name": "Kriraghor API: M18 Risk and Trust",
    "description": "Two accounts submit the same NID. The second one gets a critical accounts_per_nid flag on the risk desk, and nothing happens to it until a person acts (Q101).\n\nStaff with manage_users ask for documents, clear the flag and undo it, and suspend for up to 30 days. A master freezes payouts with a step-up code (an M07 risk_freeze hold) and undoes it. Every action is a new row with a reason.\n\nA master proposes a threshold change, which becomes an M03 change request. Reliability scores are read by the member and publicly.\n\nRequests named \"Runner\" go to the local test runner (deliver events and run the risk jobs; check the account).\n\nUnattended: `node postman/run-m18.js` (kriraghor_test database).\n\nRebuild this file with: node postman/build-collection-m18.js",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:4000/api/v1"
    },
    {
      "key": "controlUrl",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "adminAccessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "staffToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "memberToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "member1Token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "flagId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "freezeId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "clearId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "suspendId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
